{"path":"locale/has_facet","title":"std::has_facet","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>has_facet","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/has_facet","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"Checks if the locale loc implements the facet Facet.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/locale\">&lt;locale&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev\">\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-cxx11\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Facet <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> has_facet<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> locale<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> loc <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">throw</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Facet <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> has_facet<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> locale<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> loc <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks if the locale <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">loc</span></code> implements the facet <code>Facet</code>.\n</p><p>The program is ill-formed if Facet is not a <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/facet#Facet_class\">facet</a> or it is a volatile-qualified facet.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> loc\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the locale object to query\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the facet <code>Facet</code> was installed in the locale <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">loc</span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p><code>std::has_facet</code> must return <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> for all locales <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">loc</span></code> if <code>Facet</code> is one of the standard facets given <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\">here</a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"co1\">// minimal custom facet</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> myfacet <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"kw1\">public</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/facet\"><span class=\"kw1913\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">facet</span></span></a>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/id\"><span class=\"kw1912\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">id</span></span></a> id<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/id\"><span class=\"kw1912\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">id</span></span></a> myfacet<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">id</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// loc is a \"C\" locale with myfacet added</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a> loc<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/classic\"><span class=\"kw2699\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">classic</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, new myfacet<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1781\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Can loc classify chars? \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">has_facet</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype\"><span class=\"kw1954\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ctype</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>loc<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Can loc classify char32_t? \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">has_facet</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype\"><span class=\"kw1954\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ctype</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char32_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>loc<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Does loc implement myfacet? \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">has_facet</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>myfacet<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>loc<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Can loc classify chars? true\nCan loc classify char32_t? false\nDoes loc implement myfacet? true</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue436\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 436</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>it was unclear whether <code>Facet</code> can be cv-qualified\n</td>\n<td>it can be const-qualified, but not volatile-qualified\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>locale</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  set of polymorphic facets that encapsulate cultural differences <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/use_facet\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>use_facet</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains a facet from a locale <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::has_facet","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: until C++11, since C++11. Checks if the locale loc implements the facet Facet."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"loc"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Returns true if the facet Facet was installed in the locale loc, false otherwise."},{"label":"Notes","note":"std::has_facet must return true for all locales loc if Facet is one of the standard facets given here."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"locale","note":"set of polymorphic facets that encapsulate cultural differences"},{"label":"use_facet","note":"obtains a facet from a locale"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":245,"codeBlockCount":2}
